(4971475, 724049, 96881, '<td valign="top">I would have adjusted the levels on this photo, as it all seems a little dark to me, and it doesn''t have to be.  This could have brought out more differeing shades in the crayons, and therefore showed the better depth of colours.</td>', 'I would have adjusted the levels on this photo, as it all seems a little dark to me, and it doesn''t have to be.  This could have brought out more differeing shades in the crayons, and therefore showed the better depth of colours.', '2008-09-24 03:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4971476, 723700, 96881, '<td valign="top">This works.  Had seen similar on this site before.  Well taken and meets the challenge really well.  The mark on the pencil (right side) is a shame as i noticed it straight away (would have been hard to notice during set up though, and rules don''t allow its removal afterwards).<br/>Still a Great Shot, Well done</td>', 'This works.  Had seen similar on this site before.  Well taken and meets the challenge really well.  The mark on the pencil (right side) is a shame as i noticed it straight away (would have been hard to notice during set up though, and rules don''t allow its removal afterwards).Still a Great Shot, Well done', '2008-09-24 03:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4971477, 724050, 96881, '<td valign="top">Yep, Says yellow to me.  Cannot understand the Maple leaf there though.  Don''t know why you would add it there, or wouldn ''t find some arches without it on</td>', 'Yep, Says yellow to me.  Cannot understand the Maple leaf there though.  Don''t know why you would add it there, or wouldn ''t find some arches without it on', '2008-09-24 03:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4971479, 722982, 45475, '<td valign="top">This is a photo of a painting :(</td>', 'This is a photo of a painting :(', '2008-09-24 03:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4971480, 724260, 96881, '<td valign="top">i like the idea, but you have overprocessed/overexposed it.  The red to me should be a clear grey (instead of just off white) and the black righting/border ont he sign should be black.</td>', 'i like the idea, but you have overprocessed/overexposed it.  The red to me should be a clear grey (instead of just off white) and the black righting/border ont he sign should be black.', '2008-09-24 03:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4971483, 724291, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great Capture.  Things obviously went right for you to get this.  Hard to stage these and get the horses there when the rainbow is there.  Exceptional shot and stands alone (outside of the challenge topic) as a great photo, as well as meets the challenge.  Would love to see the original for this.</td>', 'Great Capture.  Things obviously went right for you to get this.  Hard to stage these and get the horses there when the rainbow is there.  Exceptional shot and stands alone (outside of the challenge topic) as a great photo, as well as meets the challenge.  Would love to see the original for this.', '2008-09-24 03:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4971485, 724078, 96881, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, but the Jug is what stands out, and its full opf water (clear) so does not portray a sense of colour to me.</td>', 'Interesting photo, but the Jug is what stands out, and its full opf water (clear) so does not portray a sense of colour to me.', '2008-09-24 03:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4971487, 722992, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea, I presume that lipstick is Ruby Red.  The lighting is a little too much in the top right, and could have had a little more on the book on the left.  Slight change of light angle (or set-up angle) just to balance that slightly.</td>', 'Nice Idea, I presume that lipstick is Ruby Red.  The lighting is a little too much in the top right, and could have had a little more on the book on the left.  Slight change of light angle (or set-up angle) just to balance that slightly.', '2008-09-24 03:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4971488, 723845, 49109, '<td valign="top">overexposed, grainy and OOF</td>', 'overexposed, grainy and OOF', '2008-09-24 03:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4971489, 722726, 96881, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Must ask why you didn''t cut the brannch so that it wasn''t going out of the photo (have it end within the photo)  A little more depth of field also could have worked, cause the back tomoto (especially back left) loos a touch soft.</td>', 'Good photo.  Must ask why you didn''t cut the brannch so that it wasn''t going out of the photo (have it end within the photo)  A little more depth of field also could have worked, cause the back tomoto (especially back left) loos a touch soft.', '2008-09-24 03:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4971491, 723565, 96881, '<td valign="top">Trying to think what colour this is.  Either a light blue, or pink maybe, but a pale colour i think.  The light onto the paint in the tin makes it a little light, that it might be pale.  It being a little more grey may have helped protray the colour.  However, good idea and well done.</td>', 'Trying to think what colour this is.  Either a light blue, or pink maybe, but a pale colour i think.  The light onto the paint in the tin makes it a little light, that it might be pale.  It being a little more grey may have helped protray the colour.  However, good idea and well done.', '2008-09-24 03:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4971492, 724381, 96881, '<td valign="top">Yep, Yellow.  Like it but the knife going out of focus by that much causes a distracting smudge in the left hand side of the photo</td>', 'Yep, Yellow.  Like it but the knife going out of focus by that much causes a distracting smudge in the left hand side of the photo', '2008-09-24 03:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4971496, 722741, 96881, '<td valign="top">I can see the vivid colours of him now.  Depth of field is brilliant.  Shame the background was not lighter to really make him stand out.  Well taken and great crop of this.</td>', 'I can see the vivid colours of him now.  Depth of field is brilliant.  Shame the background was not lighter to really make him stand out.  Well taken and great crop of this.', '2008-09-24 03:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
