(4972495, 722716, 30982, '<td valign="top">I was about to say the bee kinda disappears in the B&amp;W version, but I seem to recall they disappear in sunflower centers in color as well, so my thought of using a different conversion method wouldn''t work.  Works OK for the challenge.  If it were my composition, I''d want the bee just a bit more in the frame, maybe compose it at an angle (the bee at an angle) to create a bit of diagonal across - sometimes that gives a more dramatic feel to a shot.</td>', 'I was about to say the bee kinda disappears in the B&W version, but I seem to recall they disappear in sunflower centers in color as well, so my thought of using a different conversion method wouldn''t work.  Works OK for the challenge.  If it were my composition, I''d want the bee just a bit more in the frame, maybe compose it at an angle (the bee at an angle) to create a bit of diagonal across - sometimes that gives a more dramatic feel to a shot.', '2008-09-24 13:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
