(4972922, 724057, 87305, '<td valign="top">Very nice soft focus...</td>', 'Very nice soft focus...', '2008-09-24 16:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4972926, 723211, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very good choice for the challenge, and well executed.  Nice study of tones and textures.</td>', 'A very good choice for the challenge, and well executed.  Nice study of tones and textures.', '2008-09-24 16:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4972927, 724052, 87305, '<td valign="top">For a basic editing its incredible..</td>', 'For a basic editing its incredible..', '2008-09-24 16:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4972928, 724462, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous clarity and detail.  Needn''t be in color at all to be stunning.  Were I a betting person, I''d say maybe a deep pink?</td>', 'Gorgeous clarity and detail.  Needn''t be in color at all to be stunning.  Were I a betting person, I''d say maybe a deep pink?', '2008-09-24 16:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4972930, 724374, 87305, '<td valign="top">what a MAd Photo, jaj..very nice, 8</td>', 'what a MAd Photo, jaj..very nice, 8', '2008-09-24 16:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4972932, 724144, 30982, '<td valign="top">I prefer shots like these in B&amp;W - tends to keep the focus on the action, the faces, the forms.  No doubt it''s vibrant in color, but the "color" (colour in your case) is the action itself.  In essence, this is a very solid interpretation of the challenge on a figurative (and literal) level.  And were I to guess, I''d say this is Enzo''s.  (If not, that''s a compliment!)</td>', 'I prefer shots like these in B&W - tends to keep the focus on the action, the faces, the forms.  No doubt it''s vibrant in color, but the "color" (colour in your case) is the action itself.  In essence, this is a very solid interpretation of the challenge on a figurative (and literal) level.  And were I to guess, I''d say this is Enzo''s.  (If not, that''s a compliment!)', '2008-09-24 16:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4972936, 724208, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  Great shot.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  Great shot.', '2008-09-24 16:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4972937, 723842, 30982, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if anyone would try this - it''s what came to mind when I first saw the challenge.  I like that your artist is very intent on his task and paying no attention to you whatsoever.</td>', 'I was wondering if anyone would try this - it''s what came to mind when I first saw the challenge.  I like that your artist is very intent on his task and paying no attention to you whatsoever.', '2008-09-24 16:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4972938, 724240, 71167, '<td valign="top">Love the rich tones and composistion</td>', 'Love the rich tones and composistion', '2008-09-24 16:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4972939, 724281, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not what the challenge was asking for, but a gorgeous flower - very interesting!</td>', 'Not what the challenge was asking for, but a gorgeous flower - very interesting!', '2008-09-24 16:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4972940, 723051, 87305, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast..very soft, 8</td>', 'I like the contrast..very soft, 8', '2008-09-24 16:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
