(4972947, 724161, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nah, never inside the lines!  Go outside the lines to your heart''s content!  Nice use of DOF, good positioning of the hand doing the drawing.</td>', 'Nah, never inside the lines!  Go outside the lines to your heart''s content!  Nice use of DOF, good positioning of the hand doing the drawing.', '2008-09-24 16:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
