(4973338, 724291, 97270, '<td valign="top">How lucky would you have to be to get a rainbow show up exactly in the ''color in BW'' challenge (unless you changed the camera date to future and took it in advance.. J/K;-).<br/> <br/>Beautiful! I love how the focus drifts away to the right... and the horses (I am hoping .. no.. I want them to be exactly 7 to rhyme with the rainbow so I am not even counting them:-) Camera angle could probably have been more oblique (looking up). I wonder if a more sharp pasture would help more. Excellent find anyways!</td>', 'How lucky would you have to be to get a rainbow show up exactly in the ''color in BW'' challenge (unless you changed the camera date to future and took it in advance.. J/K;-). Beautiful! I love how the focus drifts away to the right... and the horses (I am hoping .. no.. I want them to be exactly 7 to rhyme with the rainbow so I am not even counting them:-) Camera angle could probably have been more oblique (looking up). I wonder if a more sharp pasture would help more. Excellent find anyways!', '2008-09-24 19:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973341, 723970, 97270, '<td valign="top">Clever composition. You probably wont have scored as high if the camera was set a bit low, only on the legs. I could probably lose the belt though in the crop... it is a big distraction. I recommend referring to an entry with a belt cuff in a recent challenge ''safety'' for lighting etc.</td>', 'Clever composition. You probably wont have scored as high if the camera was set a bit low, only on the legs. I could probably lose the belt though in the crop... it is a big distraction. I recommend referring to an entry with a belt cuff in a recent challenge ''safety'' for lighting etc.', '2008-09-24 19:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973344, 723297, 97270, '<td valign="top">You probably already got many comments on this, but just to be fair, this is NOT a black and white image depicting color. You would have to completely desaturate it for it to qualify.<br/> <br/>Besides all that, it is a good portrait.. the lighting could help more from the sides... and a bit more contrast would enhance the textures.</td>', 'You probably already got many comments on this, but just to be fair, this is NOT a black and white image depicting color. You would have to completely desaturate it for it to qualify. Besides all that, it is a good portrait.. the lighting could help more from the sides... and a bit more contrast would enhance the textures.', '2008-09-24 20:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
