(4973427, 724346, 97270, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors there.. yes. I can see them. I wont change a thiing in the picture.. except may be add a bit more of light and contrast.</td>', 'Pretty colors there.. yes. I can see them. I wont change a thiing in the picture.. except may be add a bit more of light and contrast.', '2008-09-24 20:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973430, 724298, 32345, '<td valign="top">No vote <br/> <br/>Just wishing you good luck :)</td>', 'No vote  Just wishing you good luck :)', '2008-09-24 20:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973432, 724384, 97270, '<td valign="top">Was it intentional to leave the name of the color on the crayon? The idea is good.. execution: not as good. Lighting, contrast, camera angle, could all be better.</td>', 'Was it intentional to leave the name of the color on the crayon? The idea is good.. execution: not as good. Lighting, contrast, camera angle, could all be better.', '2008-09-24 20:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973433, 724249, 97270, '<td valign="top">I think it. I think red. Good idea.</td>', 'I think it. I think red. Good idea.', '2008-09-24 20:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973434, 723786, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good job there. The contrast could be better.</td>', 'Good job there. The contrast could be better.', '2008-09-24 20:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973436, 722741, 97270, '<td valign="top">Clever! The subject is great. The contrast could have been a bit better.</td>', 'Clever! The subject is great. The contrast could have been a bit better.', '2008-09-24 20:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973439, 724129, 97270, '<td valign="top">Even though I cannot make out any colors other than aquamarine an/or morning oranges, this is a fabulous work of art. The fog in the background just enhances the focus on the subject.</td>', 'Even though I cannot make out any colors other than aquamarine an/or morning oranges, this is a fabulous work of art. The fog in the background just enhances the focus on the subject.', '2008-09-24 20:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973440, 723098, 97270, '<td valign="top">:-) You cant go wrong when UPS is in the scene. Good job! A more dramatic camera angle may have helped... so would a bit more of contrast.</td>', ':-) You cant go wrong when UPS is in the scene. Good job! A more dramatic camera angle may have helped... so would a bit more of contrast.', '2008-09-24 20:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973441, 724476, 97270, '<td valign="top">The color is obvious, the technical strength: not quite. I would have preferred this image to be a little less exposed. Perhaps it would interfere with the berry''s texture, but would be interesting to see nonetheless.</td>', 'The color is obvious, the technical strength: not quite. I would have preferred this image to be a little less exposed. Perhaps it would interfere with the berry''s texture, but would be interesting to see nonetheless.', '2008-09-24 20:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973442, 723591, 97270, '<td valign="top">This one is from Australia, that is almost for sure (the link on the cans:-). Good attempt. Not as sharp as it could have been IMO.</td>', 'This one is from Australia, that is almost for sure (the link on the cans:-). Good attempt. Not as sharp as it could have been IMO.', '2008-09-24 20:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973445, 724387, 97270, '<td valign="top">Smart choice of subject. A more shallow DOF would have helped I think.. as well as a tad more sharpness.</td>', 'Smart choice of subject. A more shallow DOF would have helped I think.. as well as a tad more sharpness.', '2008-09-24 20:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973447, 724140, 97270, '<td valign="top">Really bad focus, and I wont buy the argument that it was on purpose. I do not see any srong points in this image. The composition could be better, it could be more sharp, with better contrast, etc.</td>', 'Really bad focus, and I wont buy the argument that it was on purpose. I do not see any srong points in this image. The composition could be better, it could be more sharp, with better contrast, etc.', '2008-09-24 20:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973448, 724255, 97270, '<td valign="top">For some reason, if one has to hint the color away in the title, the composition itself isnt as strong IMO. The picture is great technically. I would just move the light a bit more to the right. Good job otherwise.</td>', 'For some reason, if one has to hint the color away in the title, the composition itself isnt as strong IMO. The picture is great technically. I would just move the light a bit more to the right. Good job otherwise.', '2008-09-24 20:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973456, 724183, 97270, '<td valign="top">I think this is the only hydrant picture in this pool: unique. I like the camera angle. I would have preferred it more if the focus was more in the near end. Good job anyways!</td>', 'I think this is the only hydrant picture in this pool: unique. I like the camera angle. I would have preferred it more if the focus was more in the near end. Good job anyways!', '2008-09-24 20:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973460, 722652, 97270, '<td valign="top">I fail to get a sense of any color here.. except the color of the subject''s hair or eyes.</td>', 'I fail to get a sense of any color here.. except the color of the subject''s hair or eyes.', '2008-09-24 20:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973462, 724158, 97270, '<td valign="top">:-) You dream in B&amp;W, but you are gonna fetch the ribbons in color. Excellent soft focus on the face. I wouldnt change anything in this picture.</td>', ':-) You dream in B&W, but you are gonna fetch the ribbons in color. Excellent soft focus on the face. I wouldnt change anything in this picture.', '2008-09-24 20:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973464, 723993, 97270, '<td valign="top">Perhaps its the confusing challenge description. This is one of the many images that is trying to give the color away in the title. IMO, that shouldnt be the case. The image itself should give the color away... indirectly. Please read the description.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, the image itself is very strong technically. I would rate it much higher if it were a free study.</td>', 'Perhaps its the confusing challenge description. This is one of the many images that is trying to give the color away in the title. IMO, that shouldnt be the case. The image itself should give the color away... indirectly. Please read the description. Otherwise, the image itself is very strong technically. I would rate it much higher if it were a free study.', '2008-09-24 20:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973466, 723480, 97270, '<td valign="top">This is NOT black and white.. it has COLOR components it it. Please go back and read the description again, it is simple, and straighforward, and says ''take a black and white image''.<br/> <br/>Pretty picture otherwise. I would have changed the lighting a bit... and cropped in more on the inner loops.</td>', 'This is NOT black and white.. it has COLOR components it it. Please go back and read the description again, it is simple, and straighforward, and says ''take a black and white image''. Pretty picture otherwise. I would have changed the lighting a bit... and cropped in more on the inner loops.', '2008-09-24 20:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973468, 724208, 97270, '<td valign="top">I got a new favorite image!! Thank you for this wonderful idea. The idea itself overshadows any remaining small technical glitch. I would have loved to see a better camera angle. But this one would do just fine as a winner methinks:-)<br/> <br/>Kudos my friend, you found a way to peek into our hearts through the eyes.</td>', 'I got a new favorite image!! Thank you for this wonderful idea. The idea itself overshadows any remaining small technical glitch. I would have loved to see a better camera angle. But this one would do just fine as a winner methinks:-) Kudos my friend, you found a way to peek into our hearts through the eyes.', '2008-09-24 20:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973488, 724421, 67152, '<td valign="top">really nice details</td>', 'really nice details', '2008-09-24 21:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973489, 724086, 67152, '<td valign="top">a good idea but without the glass already poured it is hard to ''see'' the red...</td>', 'a good idea but without the glass already poured it is hard to ''see'' the red...', '2008-09-24 21:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973491, 724245, 67152, '<td valign="top">the lighting here does not really emphasize the fall colors as well as I think it could</td>', 'the lighting here does not really emphasize the fall colors as well as I think it could', '2008-09-24 21:12:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4973493, 723717, 67152, '<td valign="top">one of the few outdoor nature shots that actually delivers - it is all about the lighting here</td>', 'one of the few outdoor nature shots that actually delivers - it is all about the lighting here', '2008-09-24 21:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973500, 723665, 97270, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and lighting. It also conveys the color clearly. I wouldnt change a thing in this one. Good job.</td>', 'Excellent focus and lighting. It also conveys the color clearly. I wouldnt change a thing in this one. Good job.', '2008-09-24 21:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973564, 723092, 70265, '<td valign="top">As a graphic designer, I can appreciate this (even though they look like paint chips &amp; not Pantone swatches). In any case, a great idea, well executed, and nice composition &amp; clarity. BTW commenting only</td>', 'As a graphic designer, I can appreciate this (even though they look like paint chips & not Pantone swatches). In any case, a great idea, well executed, and nice composition & clarity. BTW commenting only', '2008-09-24 22:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973565, 724278, 70265, '<td valign="top">Looks like a duotone, sorry. BTW commenting only</td>', 'Looks like a duotone, sorry. BTW commenting only', '2008-09-24 22:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973567, 724376, 70265, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I like it but want to see a tighter crop with more emphasis on the hand &amp; apple. (Although I do realize you needed to show some arm to show that she''s fallen ....) BTW commenting only</td>', 'Great idea. I like it but want to see a tighter crop with more emphasis on the hand & apple. (Although I do realize you needed to show some arm to show that she''s fallen ....) BTW commenting only', '2008-09-24 22:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973568, 723388, 70265, '<td valign="top">nice detail</td>', 'nice detail', '2008-09-24 22:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973569, 724090, 70265, '<td valign="top">I like the idea ... the execution however, is lacking in contrast &amp; clarity. Interesting lighting though, just needs to be kicked up a notch. BTW commenting only</td>', 'I like the idea ... the execution however, is lacking in contrast & clarity. Interesting lighting though, just needs to be kicked up a notch. BTW commenting only', '2008-09-24 22:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973571, 723948, 70265, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity of the berries against your nice bokeh. Interesting composition as well. BTW commenting only</td>', 'I like the clarity of the berries against your nice bokeh. Interesting composition as well. BTW commenting only', '2008-09-24 22:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973572, 724339, 70265, '<td valign="top">I really like the feel of this ... I''m not quite sure it meets the challenge entirely, but then again I don''t think anyone''s sure that they met this challenge! BTW commenting only</td>', 'I really like the feel of this ... I''m not quite sure it meets the challenge entirely, but then again I don''t think anyone''s sure that they met this challenge! BTW commenting only', '2008-09-24 22:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973573, 724217, 70265, '<td valign="top">A different angle to see the wings would have made this even stronger. BTW commenting only</td>', 'A different angle to see the wings would have made this even stronger. BTW commenting only', '2008-09-24 22:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973574, 724267, 70265, '<td valign="top">looks yummy!</td>', 'looks yummy!', '2008-09-24 22:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973575, 724304, 70265, '<td valign="top">Yes, that''s definitely red!</td>', 'Yes, that''s definitely red!', '2008-09-24 22:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973576, 723358, 70265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail.</td>', 'Beautiful detail.', '2008-09-24 22:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973578, 723843, 70265, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF, interesting border. BTW commenting only</td>', 'Great use of DOF, interesting border. BTW commenting only', '2008-09-24 22:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973581, 724471, 70265, '<td valign="top">She''s a good sport!</td>', 'She''s a good sport!', '2008-09-24 22:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973582, 723297, 70265, '<td valign="top">oooopps! You forgot to desaturate. But I''m sure everyone''s telling you that ...BTW commenting only</td>', 'oooopps! You forgot to desaturate. But I''m sure everyone''s telling you that ...BTW commenting only', '2008-09-24 22:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973583, 724240, 70265, '<td valign="top">Yes, I can see the yellow!</td>', 'Yes, I can see the yellow!', '2008-09-24 22:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973584, 724059, 70265, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge! I love Legos ...</td>', 'Great take on the challenge! I love Legos ...', '2008-09-24 22:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973585, 724411, 70265, '<td valign="top">Yes, this works.</td>', 'Yes, this works.', '2008-09-24 22:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973622, 724087, 47470, '<td valign="top">Are the circles little tomatoes?  The backlighting makes it hard to tell.</td>', 'Are the circles little tomatoes?  The backlighting makes it hard to tell.', '2008-09-24 22:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973631, 723140, 47470, '<td valign="top">In a shot where there are many of the same item, I prefer for the one that stands out the most to be placed strategically in the composition to make it stand out even more so that the eye has something definite to look at instead of wandering from one to the next.  I assume the one in the bottom middle would be considered the most prominent, but it competes with a few of the others, like the one in the top right.</td>', 'In a shot where there are many of the same item, I prefer for the one that stands out the most to be placed strategically in the composition to make it stand out even more so that the eye has something definite to look at instead of wandering from one to the next.  I assume the one in the bottom middle would be considered the most prominent, but it competes with a few of the others, like the one in the top right.', '2008-09-24 22:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973633, 723031, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think I would have framed this shot differently, with all of the in-focus tomato in the frame and less of the not-fully-in-focus tomato cropped out a bit more.</td>', 'I think I would have framed this shot differently, with all of the in-focus tomato in the frame and less of the not-fully-in-focus tomato cropped out a bit more.', '2008-09-24 22:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973641, 723903, 47470, '<td valign="top">The title is strange.  Is it a spelling mistake?<br/> <br/>The lighting highlight the chest more than it highlights the happy face, which seems to be the focus of the shot, according to the title.  Maybe a different black and white conversion would have fixed that by lightening the happy face and darkening the skin.</td>', 'The title is strange.  Is it a spelling mistake? The lighting highlight the chest more than it highlights the happy face, which seems to be the focus of the shot, according to the title.  Maybe a different black and white conversion would have fixed that by lightening the happy face and darkening the skin.', '2008-09-24 22:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973643, 723789, 47470, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, but the crop is too tight.  I wish the top of his head hadn''t been cut off.</td>', 'I like the lighting, but the crop is too tight.  I wish the top of his head hadn''t been cut off.', '2008-09-24 22:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973647, 723843, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty.  I''m not sure if I like the frame.  It seems a bit heavy.</td>', 'This is very pretty.  I''m not sure if I like the frame.  It seems a bit heavy.', '2008-09-24 22:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973652, 724470, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty scene.  It can be hard to get those foreground grasses just right, but I think this is very well done.<br/> <br/>I bet it looks even prettier in color!</td>', 'This is a very pretty scene.  It can be hard to get those foreground grasses just right, but I think this is very well done. I bet it looks even prettier in color!', '2008-09-24 22:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973663, 724393, 47470, '<td valign="top">The balloons give a nice range of grays.  I would have liked to see a basket so that the shot wouldn''t seem kinda abstract.</td>', 'The balloons give a nice range of grays.  I would have liked to see a basket so that the shot wouldn''t seem kinda abstract.', '2008-09-24 22:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973671, 723081, 47470, '<td valign="top">The background, especially the bow, keep grabbing the attention of my eyes more than wagon because the background is kinda busy and the bow is very bright.  I wonder if non-Americans will know that a Radio Flyer is a red wagon.</td>', 'The background, especially the bow, keep grabbing the attention of my eyes more than wagon because the background is kinda busy and the bow is very bright.  I wonder if non-Americans will know that a Radio Flyer is a red wagon.', '2008-09-24 22:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973680, 724476, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see more of the detail, especially in the splash.  It looks like the lighting and the high contrast took away most of that missing detail.</td>', 'I wish I could see more of the detail, especially in the splash.  It looks like the lighting and the high contrast took away most of that missing detail.', '2008-09-24 22:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973684, 723145, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think a closer shot of just the pencils would look better compositionally.</td>', 'I think a closer shot of just the pencils would look better compositionally.', '2008-09-24 22:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973689, 724024, 47470, '<td valign="top">i think I would have liked this better with a darker background.  The white is a bit overpowering.</td>', 'i think I would have liked this better with a darker background.  The white is a bit overpowering.', '2008-09-24 22:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973692, 724366, 47470, '<td valign="top">I like how the shadow fades into the background, but I think the composition would be helped more if the crayon were on a stronger angle, probably from top left to bottom right, since that is the way most westerners read.</td>', 'I like how the shadow fades into the background, but I think the composition would be helped more if the crayon were on a stronger angle, probably from top left to bottom right, since that is the way most westerners read.', '2008-09-24 22:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973697, 724432, 47470, '<td valign="top">The lights look cool, but the blur on the person is distracting.  I''m also not realy sure what color this should make me think of.</td>', 'The lights look cool, but the blur on the person is distracting.  I''m also not realy sure what color this should make me think of.', '2008-09-24 22:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973700, 723189, 47470, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice composition.', '2008-09-24 22:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973702, 724421, 47470, '<td valign="top">The stem and the pepper are similar shades of gray.  Different shades (possibly obtained through a different black and white conversion?) might have added some interest to this shot.</td>', 'The stem and the pepper are similar shades of gray.  Different shades (possibly obtained through a different black and white conversion?) might have added some interest to this shot.', '2008-09-24 23:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973710, 724276, 47470, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections, especially the second square in the middle row (it looks kinda like a peace sign!).  I think a more severe tilt would have strengthened the composition.  I''m also not really sure what color(s) this is supposed to emphasize or represent.</td>', 'I like the reflections, especially the second square in the middle row (it looks kinda like a peace sign!).  I think a more severe tilt would have strengthened the composition.  I''m also not really sure what color(s) this is supposed to emphasize or represent.', '2008-09-24 23:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973713, 722825, 47470, '<td valign="top">The image seems a bit too gray.  Upping the contrast to add more white and more black would make everything stand out better.  Since most westerners read from the top left to the bottom right, the eye sees it as strange when text is angled the opposite way.</td>', 'The image seems a bit too gray.  Upping the contrast to add more white and more black would make everything stand out better.  Since most westerners read from the top left to the bottom right, the eye sees it as strange when text is angled the opposite way.', '2008-09-24 23:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973717, 723970, 47470, '<td valign="top">The composition might have been helped a bit if all of the lines weren''t vertical or horizontal.  Maybe tilt the camera?</td>', 'The composition might have been helped a bit if all of the lines weren''t vertical or horizontal.  Maybe tilt the camera?', '2008-09-24 23:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973723, 724430, 47470, '<td valign="top">Blacker blacks (upping the contrast) might make everything stand out a bit better.</td>', 'Blacker blacks (upping the contrast) might make everything stand out a bit better.', '2008-09-24 23:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973725, 723700, 47470, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and contrast.</td>', 'Nice detail and contrast.', '2008-09-24 23:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973727, 724181, 47470, '<td valign="top">The C and the R get lost since they are so much lighter than the other letters.  I wonder if there would be a way to make them darker during the black and white conversion.</td>', 'The C and the R get lost since they are so much lighter than the other letters.  I wonder if there would be a way to make them darker during the black and white conversion.', '2008-09-24 23:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973732, 722785, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop on the strawberries would have looked nicer since they have such great detail.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop on the strawberries would have looked nicer since they have such great detail.', '2008-09-24 23:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973736, 724036, 47470, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I wish the light brought out the rose more than the person..</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I wish the light brought out the rose more than the person..', '2008-09-24 23:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973738, 724240, 47470, '<td valign="top">Is it an orange peel hanging on the edge of a glass bowl?  This would make a cool abstract shot.</td>', 'Is it an orange peel hanging on the edge of a glass bowl?  This would make a cool abstract shot.', '2008-09-24 23:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973740, 724147, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think the composition would have been stringer if the main tire in the middle of the shot wasn''t cut off at the bottom.</td>', 'I think the composition would have been stringer if the main tire in the middle of the shot wasn''t cut off at the bottom.', '2008-09-24 23:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973743, 723984, 47470, '<td valign="top">Nice detail.  I think I would have preferred if the windmill wasn''t cut off at the top and bottom.</td>', 'Nice detail.  I think I would have preferred if the windmill wasn''t cut off at the top and bottom.', '2008-09-24 23:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973746, 724247, 47470, '<td valign="top">It took me a moment to find the moon.  Maybe a tighter crop on the water and clouds with a bit of sky would make it stand out more.</td>', 'It took me a moment to find the moon.  Maybe a tighter crop on the water and clouds with a bit of sky would make it stand out more.', '2008-09-24 23:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973748, 722901, 47470, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the contrast.  Great expression too.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the contrast.  Great expression too.', '2008-09-24 23:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973767, 724387, 98882, '<td valign="top">I would love this if it were just a bit sharper.</td>', 'I would love this if it were just a bit sharper.', '2008-09-24 23:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973769, 722779, 98882, '<td valign="top">Flags are, to me, not a very interesting subject.</td>', 'Flags are, to me, not a very interesting subject.', '2008-09-24 23:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973774, 723845, 98882, '<td valign="top">i like the assumed depth  in this work.</td>', 'i like the assumed depth  in this work.', '2008-09-24 23:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973779, 723480, 97760, '<td valign="top">no color</td>', 'no color', '2008-09-24 23:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973784, 723717, 97760, '<td valign="top">wait a minute how didyou take this spring picture when its fall?</td>', 'wait a minute how didyou take this spring picture when its fall?', '2008-09-24 23:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973785, 724374, 98882, '<td valign="top">very creative.</td>', 'very creative.', '2008-09-24 23:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973788, 723986, 98882, '<td valign="top">Excellent, Very Original in style.</td>', 'Excellent, Very Original in style.', '2008-09-24 23:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973794, 724140, 93756, '<td valign="top">This could be any color - the subject doesn''t tell me. Not in focus.</td>', 'This could be any color - the subject doesn''t tell me. Not in focus.', '2008-09-24 23:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4973797, 724086, 98882, '<td valign="top">I would like this more if there were some element of the work that showed the content of the bottle.</td>', 'I would like this more if there were some element of the work that showed the content of the bottle.', '2008-09-24 23:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
