(4974043, 724158, 96881, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous Photo.  The sogtness I presume is intentional to give the dreamy look (otjhers might whinge though).  I Like the negative space.  The crop works well.  However, it doesn''t really hit me with a sense of colour.  I can see where you are coming from though...</td>', 'Gorgeous Photo.  The sogtness I presume is intentional to give the dreamy look (otjhers might whinge though).  I Like the negative space.  The crop works well.  However, it doesn''t really hit me with a sense of colour.  I can see where you are coming from though...', '2008-09-25 01:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
