(4974781, 723001, 86447, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t say ''color'' to me.   Tough challenge topic to shoot for, I know.<br/> <br/>Regardless of that, I wish I could see just a bit of an eye.</td>', 'This doesn''t say ''color'' to me.   Tough challenge topic to shoot for, I know. Regardless of that, I wish I could see just a bit of an eye.', '2008-09-25 13:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
