(4984325, 724433, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a startling capture -- excellent. For this challenge, I don''t think it conveyed color, because I couldn''t recognize it as a blue jay. Depending on the mood you are trying to convey, this may or may not be a good b&amp;w conversion. If you are trying to create a scary/ominous mood, you did a very good job -- the sort of thing that might go over well in Grimm Fairy Tales. If you are trying to show a close up of a bird in flight, it is a little dark to make out the details. But if your question is about the score, I would say it is because of the color aspect of the challenge.</td>', 'I think it''s a startling capture -- excellent. For this challenge, I don''t think it conveyed color, because I couldn''t recognize it as a blue jay. Depending on the mood you are trying to convey, this may or may not be a good b&w conversion. If you are trying to create a scary/ominous mood, you did a very good job -- the sort of thing that might go over well in Grimm Fairy Tales. If you are trying to show a close up of a bird in flight, it is a little dark to make out the details. But if your question is about the score, I would say it is because of the color aspect of the challenge.', '2008-10-01 11:02:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4984329, 724291, 36606, '<td valign="top">stunning work. Are you going to post the colour version?</td>', 'stunning work. Are you going to post the colour version?', '2008-10-01 11:03:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4984335, 724462, 98171, '<td valign="top">good job!</td>', 'good job!', '2008-10-01 11:07:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4984343, 724433, 7743, '<td valign="top">Black and white is based on contrast and texture to name a couple of components and you seem to have lost a lot of the contrast and texture in the conversion.<br/> <br/>If you can process it to get more detail showing on the head and get some brightness in the eyes I think it would be a great improvement.</td>', 'Black and white is based on contrast and texture to name a couple of components and you seem to have lost a lot of the contrast and texture in the conversion. If you can process it to get more detail showing on the head and get some brightness in the eyes I think it would be a great improvement.', '2008-10-01 11:09:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4984346, 723986, 97853, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2008-10-01 11:10:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4984347, 724419, 52115, '<td valign="top">Yes it really feals like strong color on a dark background. What colr was it, Yellow or White, or other?</td>', 'Yes it really feals like strong color on a dark background. What colr was it, Yellow or White, or other?', '2008-10-01 11:11:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4984351, 724433, 90495, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a hawk than a blue jay. Great capture but it doesn''t convey colour to me. Very dramatic shot.</td>', 'Looks more like a hawk than a blue jay. Great capture but it doesn''t convey colour to me. Very dramatic shot.', '2008-10-01 11:14:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4984370, 723984, 66952, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this didn''t do better. Excellent B&amp;W conversion, the pinwheel has texture and shape. One of my faves, anyway.</td>', 'I''m surprised this didn''t do better. Excellent B&W conversion, the pinwheel has texture and shape. One of my faves, anyway.', '2008-10-01 11:26:58.000000', NULL, 0),
