(4985413, 724434, 28423, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for your comments and crits! It so interesting how people have different views about the exact same things, but that is what makes us all great! Chromeydome Thanks for the "PostLuminous" Nominee, its an honor just to be nominated!</td>', 'Thank you everyone for your comments and crits! It so interesting how people have different views about the exact same things, but that is what makes us all great! Chromeydome Thanks for the "PostLuminous" Nominee, its an honor just to be nominated!', '2008-10-01 17:51:37.000000', NULL, 0),
