(4985588, 724374, 83080, '<td valign="top">Hey Jack, Stop out-thinking the voters. :P  I gave you a 7 for technical merit and yes, it did strike me as odd to only use lemons for color in this challenge.  Putting the lemons in place of the yolks?!?  That still makes me chuckle.</td>', 'Hey Jack, Stop out-thinking the voters. :P  I gave you a 7 for technical merit and yes, it did strike me as odd to only use lemons for color in this challenge.  Putting the lemons in place of the yolks?!?  That still makes me chuckle.', '2008-10-01 19:32:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4985630, 723200, 83080, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Every once in a while I am shocked to see a photo score so much lower than I scored it.  The funny thing is that I''m fairly color blind and didn''t even notice the yellows other commenters point out.  Still looks b/w to me :)<br/> <br/>Still, despite the DMNCs, this is a lovely photo and I hope you keep entering shots of this quality in the future.</td>', 'Wow.  Every once in a while I am shocked to see a photo score so much lower than I scored it.  The funny thing is that I''m fairly color blind and didn''t even notice the yellows other commenters point out.  Still looks b/w to me :) Still, despite the DMNCs, this is a lovely photo and I hope you keep entering shots of this quality in the future.', '2008-10-01 19:50:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4985635, 724419, 14369, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by justamistere:</b></div><hr/><i> Yes it really feals like strong color on a dark background. What colr was it, Yellow or White, or other? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The color was yellow...</td>', 'Originally posted by justamistere: Yes it really feals like strong color on a dark background. What colr was it, Yellow or White, or other?   The color was yellow...', '2008-10-01 19:51:44.000000', NULL, 0),
