(4991854, 724345, 66384, '<td valign="top">I can''t imagine how difficult it must have been to set this up so perfectly. Even if I had this idea, which I didn''t, and even if I could have taken such a good clear photograph, which I can''t, I would never have been able to set it up without having a mess. There is not one thing out of place here, and I am astonished once again by your ability.</td>', 'I can''t imagine how difficult it must have been to set this up so perfectly. Even if I had this idea, which I didn''t, and even if I could have taken such a good clear photograph, which I can''t, I would never have been able to set it up without having a mess. There is not one thing out of place here, and I am astonished once again by your ability.', '2008-10-04 21:32:09.000000', NULL, 0),
