(4997008, 724426, 96721, '<td valign="top">I think this was really harshly voted to be honest, the image is not bad at all and with a bit of PP comes up really quite nicely, I hope you do not mind Geinafets but I took a few minutes to do a couple of basic adjustments and this is how the image scrubs up:<br/> <br/>[thumb]729136[/thumb]<br/> <br/>theres a few little jaggies around the belt area that could be worked out with some more time but I expected that bit to be a problem when I looked at the image initially.</td>', 'I think this was really harshly voted to be honest, the image is not bad at all and with a bit of PP comes up really quite nicely, I hope you do not mind Geinafets but I took a few minutes to do a couple of basic adjustments and this is how the image scrubs up: [thumb]729136[/thumb] theres a few little jaggies around the belt area that could be worked out with some more time but I expected that bit to be a problem when I looked at the image initially.', '2008-10-07 15:55:22.000000', NULL, 0),
