(5515287, 723001, 82707, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  I think you met the challenge well and it should have finished higher.  I would prefer to see the forehead and nose as sharp as the rest of the image.... as I feel the challege that you were meeting was about colour, and I think you did that beautifully and creatively......that''s a bit DPC''er ish...but, JMO!  Nice composition and beautiful lighting, and a strong image.<br/> <br/>OMG!!!! I just looked at the stats.... and ..... 9 - 1''s.....really glad to see you still here and contributing!!  :)<br/> <br/>ETA:  I see ''Red''!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-06-05 06:46:17.</i></td>', 'Very creative!  I think you met the challenge well and it should have finished higher.  I would prefer to see the forehead and nose as sharp as the rest of the image.... as I feel the challege that you were meeting was about colour, and I think you did that beautifully and creatively......that''s a bit DPC''er ish...but, JMO!  Nice composition and beautiful lighting, and a strong image. OMG!!!! I just looked at the stats.... and ..... 9 - 1''s.....really glad to see you still here and contributing!!  :) ETA:  I see ''Red''!!', '2009-06-05 07:44:42.000000', '2009-06-05 07:46:17.000000', 0),
